Package: oobindiff
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Description: Sovereign Binary Differ
 Structural binary differ identifying patch blocks and byte sequence displacements.
 100% pure native openOODA (.oo) utility with zero ambient authority,
 dual POSIX CLI and streaming JSON-RPC 2.0 Model Context Protocol (MCP) server.
